  "rule": "A pressing stance kept while moving: each second you stay Pressing in it adds a Walk Slowly stack; each stack raises the Physical damage of your next staff strike by 6 % and is spent by it. Becoming Composed or firing an escape art clears all stacks and leaves the stance.",
  "hooks": [
   "pressing",
   "composed",
   "stance",
   "staff"
  ],
  "notes": "Defines the walk-slowly pressing stance (matching xuyen_lam.techniques.json and auth-eff-1 d23 The Long Road). Applies dmg_more as an instant 1 ms temp_mod on staff art_fired and clears walk_slowly on hit_landed/was_evaded so who-is-afraid-cleanse always sees pre-spend stacks and non-staff/basic hits never steal stacks.",
  "sources": [
   "world-depth:xuyen_lam"
  ]
